This module reads the complete fixed successor generated by the
source/current-only composite action.  It closes the simplicity, P286
constitutive, and Lorentz channels at every spacetime point and identifies
the gravity-auxiliary channel with the exhaustive curvature assembly seam.

All statements are readbacks of the one existing successor.  No residual,
support coordinate, target equation, or seam enters an action constructor.
-/

